From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Make Altering Cave external sets permanently available

Reference: pret/pokeemerald @ 5eff78649e7170a877b961ef0b3da13b81a16038

Ticket islands are intentionally NOT modified here. Their original travel
logic remains intact; permanent access is handled by distributing the
corresponding event tickets through patch 0002.

This patch only removes the external Mystery Gift dependency from Altering
Cave by making every encounter table reachable in normal play.

diff --git a/src/wild_encounter.c b/src/wild_encounter.c
--- a/src/wild_encounter.c
+++ b/src/wild_encounter.c
@@ -318,9 +318,10 @@
             if (gSaveBlock1Ptr->location.mapGroup == MAP_GROUP(MAP_ALTERING_CAVE) &&
                 gSaveBlock1Ptr->location.mapNum == MAP_NUM(MAP_ALTERING_CAVE))
             {
-                u16 alteringCaveId = VarGet(VAR_ALTERING_CAVE_WILD_SET);
-                if (alteringCaveId >= NUM_ALTERING_CAVE_TABLES)
-                    alteringCaveId = 0;
+                // External Mystery Gift originally selected one table through
+                // VAR_ALTERING_CAVE_WILD_SET. Keep every table permanently
+                // reachable without any external distribution.
+                u16 alteringCaveId = Random() % NUM_ALTERING_CAVE_TABLES;
 
                 i += alteringCaveId;
             }
